$n$ & $\sigma_3(n)$ & $\sigma_7(n)$ & $(\sigma_3\star\sigma_3)(n)$ & $\sigma_3(n)+120(\sigma_3\star\sigma_3)(n)$ \\
\midrule
$2$ & $9$   & $129$   & $1$   & $129$ \\
$3$ & $28$  & $2188$  & $18$  & $2188$ \\
